{"title":"Career Roadmap · Bank Officer","role":"Bank Officer","summary":"A Bank Officer works across banking operations, customer relationships, credit, branch administration, financial products, compliance, and risk management. B.Com Financial Markets (BFM) and B.Com Banking & Insurance (BBI) provide a relevant foundation, although the exact eligibility for officer recruitment varies by bank and recruitment process.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The degree can lead to both private-sector banking roles and competitive public-sector banking officer examinations."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus","Typical Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Banking Foundation"},{"text":"B.Com + banking knowledge + internships + competitive-exam preparation"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Officer-Level Banking"},{"text":"Bank Officer, PO, Credit Officer, Relationship Manager"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Banking Specialisation"},{"text":"Branch Manager, Credit Manager, Risk Manager, Operations Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Banking Leadership"},{"text":"Senior Branch Manager, Regional Manager, Credit Head, Risk Head, Banking Operations Head"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the B.Com Degree","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Commerce & Banking Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a strong foundation in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial accounting"},{"text":"Business economics"},{"text":"Business mathematics"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Banking fundamentals"},{"text":"Financial markets"},{"text":"Business communication"},{"text":"Business law"},{"text":"Principles of management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microsoft Excel"},{"text":"Financial statement reading"},